    "body": "Thank you for this clear report and the worked example.\n\nTriage: `bug`, `P1`, `effort:high`, `area:2d`. A part that comes free while the spindle turns, with no message, is unsafe output, so this is P1 (fix now). Toolpath changes are always at least `effort:high`.\n\nClaim recorded for @HansFel - label and assignee set (only collaborators can set labels; your comment is the claim).\n\nFor the PR, please include:\n- A pinning test that measures the bridge at the channel centre line for a tab width below, equal to and above the tool diameter.\n- A test for the refusal by name when no tab can stay.\n- The changed goldens, if any, with one line on why each one moved.\n",
